  "other_public_variants": "No other value/pattern/finance forms occur in the frozen six positive inputs. A renderer may implement other public variants explicitly, or fail on encountering an unexpected form. Never drop, default, serialize as empty or replace by evaluator result.",
  "source_array_order": "Every source vector retains original order, including function/declaration/ctor/field/arm/argument/parameter/child lists.",
  "t3_site": "owner=Entry string or {Function:index}; expr owner-local ExtExpr preorder root0; value Literal-local ExtValue preorder root0; pattern arm-local ExtPattern preorder root0; no ExprId/SourceOccurrenceId equivalence.",
